# Both halves of the project, in one place. Patterns are path-agnostic, so a
# single file is less to keep in step than one per directory.

# --- Secrets. Never commit either of these. ---------------------------------
# The web tool's environment file holds the database password, session secret
# and DNS token; the local app's config holds a device bearer token.
.env
.env.local
config.json
*.token

# --- Node (web/) ------------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
npm-debug.log*

# --- Python (local/) --------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
build/
dist/
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/

# --- Everywhere -------------------------------------------------------------
*.log
.DS_Store
